# BEAVIS2 lab baseline after every build/deploy

On the **BEAVIS2** lab host (`hostname` Beavis2 / `192.168.55.197`),
password recovery and elevation **recur as broken** because agents run
`db-init --confirm` (or otherwise wipe `offline_*` rows) and then
deploy/restart the server **without** re-running `seed-dev`. The admin
UI shows zero endpoints; recover and elevation mint fail. This is a
**fixture gap**, not a product regression.

## Hard rule

> **After every server or agent build/deploy on BEAVIS2, before claiming
> done:** verify Beavis2 endpoint + password recovery + elevation
> channel. If any fail → restore immediately. Never leave the lab
> broken. Never run destructive `db-init --confirm` without immediate
> re-seed + SoftHSM fix + assert.

Concretely, before ending the turn:

1. **Verify Beavis2 endpoint** exists and is healthy
   (`GET /api/offline/endpoints` includes
   `machine_id` `3a7b240e-9327-44b8-97b6-38fb7812b3b2` or name match).
2. **Verify password recovery** succeeds for **`liebsoft`** or
   **`lanicu`** (never rotate/`phil`).
3. **Verify elevation channel**: `aic-offline-agent-service` RUNNING,
   pipe `aic-offline-agent-service\elevation` present,
   `elevation_configured` in agent `runtime-status.json`, and
   `POST /api/admin/elevation/platform/mint-v3` succeeds.
4. **If any fail** → restore:
   ```powershell
   cd c:\analog-pim\pim-offline-server
   powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\Assert-Beavis2LabBaseline.ps1 -Repair
   # or: Restore-Beavis2Lab.ps1 -SkipDeploy -SkipDbInit -SkipCryptoPrep
   ```
5. **Never** run `db-init --confirm` without immediately following with
   `Restore-Beavis2Lab.ps1` (or seed-dev + SoftHSM + assert).

Prefer the assert script (also hooked at the end of
`Deploy-OfflineServerDev.ps1` when hostname/IP matches the lab):

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\Assert-Beavis2LabBaseline.ps1 -Repair
```

## Causal chain (document in status replies when restoring)

`db-init` wipe → zero endpoints → deploy without `seed-dev` → UI empty /
recover fail / elevation mint fail. Secondary: unimported agent
settings; HSM custody blocking seed. Full write-up:
`pim-offline-server/docs/dev/beavis2-lab-baseline.md`.

